Source of the legal texts: CNLEGIS, the legal database of the Direction du CNLEGIS, Secrétariat Général du
Gouvernement, Primature, Republic of Madagascar: https://cnlegis.gov.mg/

Terms of use: CNLEGIS publishes none. Its pages carry only the footer "© 2018 DIRCNLEGIS ." (checked
2026-10-28; /mentions-legales/, /cgu/ and /conditions-utilisation/ return the generic search page). Its robots.txt
disallows GPTBot and allows every other agent. The reuse terms for the legal texts are therefore unclear:
this repository is private and is not to be published until they are settled.

The texts are official acts of the Republic of Madagascar, as printed by CNLEGIS. Only the Journal officiel
de la République de Madagascar is authoritative. The 2009 version is derived (replayed) from official texts
by the method in REPRODUCE.md; it is not published by CNLEGIS.

Attribution for the legal texts: "Texts: CNLEGIS, Direction du CNLEGIS (Primature), https://cnlegis.gov.mg/".

The history (commits and commit messages), the tables and the tools are dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
